{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10197","headline":"送窦拾遗赴朝因寄中书十七弟 · 李嘉佑","name":"送窦拾遗赴朝因寄中书十七弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自叹未沾黄纸诏，那堪远送赤墀人。\n老爲侨客偏相恋，素是诗家倍益亲。\n妻儿共载无羁思，鸳鹭同行不负身。\n凭尔将书通令弟，唯论华发愧头巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}